# Data & secrets (never commit).
# data/ is gitignored EXCEPT the committed M1 human-gate artifact review.csv. The full
# registry/catalog/raw are large + regenerable (`pmlab mentions discover|parse|registry`), so they
# stay out; review.csv (flagged subset + owner corrections) is the durable, auditable record.
/data/*
!/data/universe/
/data/universe/*
!/data/universe/review.csv
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
*.parquet

# Tooling caches
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# Local figures scratch (committed figures live under docs/figs/)
/figs/

# MCP / tooling artifacts
.playwright-mcp/

# C++ engine build tree
cpp/build/

# Optional native engine module built from cpp/ (see src/pmlab/study/engine.py)
src/pmlab/_engine*.so
